WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:03.580
- Everybody has to wake up every day

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:05.440
and make a decision.

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.950
- In every situation.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.740
- You can either choose to look at it

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.180
negatively or you can choose
to try to find the good.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:14.363
- And say fuck it, I
should be able to be happy.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:18.970
- It's a really interesting question.

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:23.970
I felt like life handed me an
extremely unfair set of cards.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.380
- My gender at birth, was female

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:30.510
but I knew, for sure, that I was a man.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:31.940
- I was the boy with no legs.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:33.490
- I was unfulfilled.

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:35.280
- I struggled with PTSD.

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:36.753
- And I was told I have cancer.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.880
- [Narrator] I felt like
my best was a failure.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:45.160
- [Narrator] I was telling
myself that I wasn't enough.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.960
- [Narrator] I locked myself away.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:48.460
- [Narrator] I felt voiceless.

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:49.320
- [Narrator] Trapped.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.610
- [Narrator] Extremely angry.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:53.330
- I let the opinions of other people

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:55.730
literally dictate how I felt.

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:57.930
- And I asked myself why?

00:00:57.930 --> 00:00:59.923
- I just knew, in that moment,

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:02.860
something has to change.

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:05.010
- And everything just hit me, it's like...

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:07.910
- Fuck it, I should be able to be happy.

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:09.880
- And I started looking into myself.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.890
- And in that one specific moment,

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:15.430
I was able to find my
confidence in myself.

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:19.470
- Taking control of my life was a rebirth.

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:23.430
- Shedding all that baggage
was complete freedom.

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:25.460
- I was putting trust in me.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:28.000
- And how I was gonna fulfill my life.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.330
- That was my time where
I kind of realized that,

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:32.270
you know what, I got somethin' to prove.

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:33.940
- And I felt really empowered.
- Invincible.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:34.773
- Alive.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:37.790
- All of the sudden, I
wasn't the victim anymore.

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:38.923
I would be the victor.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:43.460
- [Narrator] Now, I am an online
fitness coach, cancer free.

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:45.090
- [Narrator] I use cooking as a therapy.

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:47.200
- [Narrator] I am a transgender activist.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.990
- [Narrator] I've won two gold, two silver

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:51.640
and a bronze medal at
the Paralympic Games.

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:54.170
- [Narrator] I'm doing
something that I love

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:55.440
for a living.

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:57.040
- Life is not easy.

00:01:57.040 --> 00:01:59.760
- Why feed something
that's already so negative

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:01.510
in my life, with more negativity?

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:03.450
- You had control over that.

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:05.910
- There are no excuses, ever.

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:07.730
- There's no no in the equation.

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:10.860
There's no can'ts in the
equation, there's always a way.

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:13.750
- It's a responsibility to yourself.

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:16.303
- Your happiness is a choice away.

00:02:18.256 --> 00:02:20.493
- Use it as an opportunity
to write the next chapter.

00:02:22.076 --> 00:02:24.659
(upbeat music)

